# Allowlist: the image only needs the workspace manifests and the crates
# (migrations, templates and assets are embedded at compile time). Anything
# else - docs/node_modules, local databases, editor state - would bloat the
# context and invalidate the build cache on unrelated changes.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
# The build settings (SQLite compile flags).
!.cargo/config.toml
**/.DS_Store
